        <description>Use this tool to retrieve transactions on the customer's selected financial account for the last 5 days to investigate suspicious or fraudulent activity.

When to call:
- Call this tool after an account has been selected via 'select_customer_financial_account'.

Inputs to provide:
- 'financial_account_sys_id': Pass the Sys ID of the selected account from 'selected_account_sys_id'.
- 'days_back': Set to 5 (or leave blank for default 5 days).

Outputs &amp; Customer Response:
- Use the 'voice_agent_message' to read the last 5 days of transactions to the customer.
